{"v":4,"catch":"無底線出軌，到處亂跑。","desc":"《ESCAPE KIDS》是KONAMI於1987年發行的運動動作遊戲。\nESCAPE KIDS 只有一條規則：比其他人跑得更快。\n使用“RUN”和“SUPER JUMP”按鈕贏得未來的超級英雄比賽。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-01-16","genres":["運動","動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–4 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":4,"poff":4,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/473d14c7cd4db7b9e2bab2d7b987d3effe4b5757c9a49490b9509a58f1959cdf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4b7447b9939f575bd46a3e2a1adfae7fde943f9cb6419c12df2f461d6f579b13.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b101fe67447ae4f589253ee882348a9d406ab91c00d7a34ea7299d3856ff1d0a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/90eff6efbb89ca9900e360da4699ea3162e837e3ab3d0330b3c674fd772e416b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f48a192f5b9897b940bbec0c417828bd3b23fb5acc9d2c0a700372f667de7ab6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d33f54fbf4e11ac5bcf05b214876a96ec6cbec4ddec83b5d5c3dc60643b8c197.jpg"],"titleId":"01003fa020bca000","dlc":[]}